# 5. INTEGRATED ARCHITECTURE

The three components must work together through standardized interfaces.

## 5.1 Data Flow

User
→ Derecho IA API
→ Legal AI Agent
→ Query Understanding
→ Task Planning
→ Tool Registry
→ RAG Engine
→ STAIR + Hybrid Retrieval
→ Legal Context
→ LLM Engine
→ Selected LLM Provider
→ Legal Analysis
→ Citation Verification
→ Structured Response
→ User Interface

## 5.2 Component Responsibilities

| Component | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| RAG Engine | Find and prepare legal knowledge |
| LLM Engine | Provide language-model capabilities |
| Legal AI Agent | Orchestrate research and analysis |
| STAIR | Retrieve hierarchical legal context |
| PostgreSQL | Store legal data and metadata |
| pgvector | Store and search embeddings |

No component should duplicate another component's responsibilities.

